\begin{enumerate}
\item We adapt the standard properties and order them: non-wastefulness must be score-relative, as must every fairness notion a \emph{matched} student can invoke, while an unmatched claimant's needs no weakening (Lemma~\ref{lem:fair-sf}). Between the two we place \emph{across-category fairness} (Def.~\ref{def:across}), admitting a complaint only against a weaker occupant of a preferred category, and Lemma~\ref{lem:hierarchy} nests the four notions. We also fix what capacity change and an unfilled quota mean (Section~\ref{sec:model}).
